# Environment
# `.env` holds real secrets, including the admin password, and used to be
# committed. Keep it local. A fresh checkout needs SUPABASE_URL,
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY and their VITE_ twins to build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

